meta {
  name: Get SeaweedFS Capacity
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/seaweedfs/capacity
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  # Get SeaweedFS Capacity

  SeaweedFS의 물리적 스토리지 용량 정보를 조회합니다.

  ## Response

  ### Success (200)
  ```json
  {
    "code": 200000,
    "message": "OK",
    "data": {
      "totalCapacity": 1099511627776,
      "usedSpace": 549755813888,
      "freeSpace": 549755813888,
      "percentUsed": 50.0
    }
  }
  ```

  ### Response Fields (SeaweedFSCapacityResponse)

  | Field | Type | Description |
  |-------|------|-------------|
  | totalCapacity | number | 전체 용량 (bytes) |
  | usedSpace | number | 사용 중인 용량 (bytes) |
  | freeSpace | number | 남은 용량 (bytes) |
  | percentUsed | number | 사용률 (%) |

  ### Capacity Unit Conversion

  | Value | Unit |
  |-------|------|
  | 1,099,511,627,776 | 1 TB |
  | 1,073,741,824 | 1 GB |
  | 1,048,576 | 1 MB |

  ### Error (503) - SeaweedFS Unavailable
  ```json
  {
    "code": 503000,
    "message": "SeaweedFS is not available",
    "data": null
  }
  ```
}
